</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">initial value </td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">F</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">feed</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">P</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">permeate</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">R</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">retentate</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subscript</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">i</td><td align="left" valign="middle" rowspan="1" colspan="1">component</td></tr></tbody></array></glossary><app-group><app id="app1-membranes-13-00692"><title>Appendix A</title><p>The mathematical model includes the following assumptions: isothermal conditions; plug flow in feed membrane module channel; permeate is drained from the membrane without mixing between surrounding regions for the cross-flow mode or plug flow in the permeate membrane module channel for the counter-current mode; and gas permeance is independent of feed gas composition and process conditions (<xref rid="membranes-13-00692-f0A1" ref-type="fig">Figure A1</xref> and <xref rid="membranes-13-00692-f0A2" ref-type="fig">Figure A2</xref>).</p><fig position="anchor" id="membranes-13-00692-f0A1" orientation="portrait"><label>Figure A1</label><caption><p>Scheme of cross-flow mode of mass transfer calculation in the membrane module used in the modeling.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" position="float" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="membranes-13-00692-g0A1.jpg"><?image-name membranes-13-00692-g0A1.jpg?><?image-size 26816?><?image-md5 9998b5a030ff8b72449e2a3fdedf3114?><?image-image-server-status LOAD_COMPLETED?><?image-original-height 1124?><?image-original-width 2674?><?image-scaled-height 321?><?image-scaled-width 764?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/bc11/10456246/9998b5a030ff/membranes-13-00692-g0A1.jpg?><?thumb-name membranes-13-00692-g0A1.gif?><?thumb-size 3193?><?thumb-md5 5936b0434a5c98a0954a2b511207051a?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 80?><?thumb-scaled-width 190?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/bc11/10456246/5936b0434a5c/membranes-13-00692-g0A1.gif?></graphic></fig><p>Cross-flow mode:<disp-formula id="FD1-membranes-13-00692"><label>(A1)</label><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="mm1" display="block" overflow="scroll"><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>{</mml:mo><mml:mtable columnalign="left"><mml:mtr><mml:mtd><mml:mo>Δ</mml:mo><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>J</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>F</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:mo stretchy="false">(</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="false">)</mml:mo><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>Q</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>p</mml:mi><mml:mrow/><mml:mi>F</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>y</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>F</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:mo stretchy="false">(</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="false">)</mml:mo><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>p</mml:mi><mml:mrow/><mml:mi>P</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>y</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>P</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:mo stretchy="false">(</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="false">)</mml:mo></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow><mml:mo>Δ</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi></mml:mtd></mml:mtr><mml:mtr><mml:mtd><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>J</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>P</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:mo stretchy="false">(</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="false">)</mml:mo><mml:mo>=</mml:mo><mml:msub><mml:mi>Q</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi></mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mo>(</mml:mo><mml:mrow><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>p</mml:mi><mml:mrow/><mml:mi>F</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>y</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>F</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:mo stretchy="false">(</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="false">)</mml:mo><mml:mo>−</mml:mo><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>p</mml:mi><mml:mrow/><mml:mi>P</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>y</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>P</mml:mi></mml:msubsup><mml:mo stretchy="false">(</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mo stretchy="false">)</mml:mo></mml:mrow><mml:mo>)</mml:mo></mml:mrow><mml:mo>Δ</mml:mo><mml:mi>a</mml:mi></mml:mtd></mml:mtr><mml:mtr><mml:mtd><mml:msubsup><mml:mi>y</mml:mi><mml:mi>i</mml:mi><mml:mi>F</mml:mi></mml:msub